 * Shared by the search overlay (search/form.phtml) and the search results page (search/page.phtml):
 * - window.nexoraiqProduct: product hit helpers (prices incl. special price and variant ranges, URLs,
 *   stock, GraphQL variant field support).
 * - window.nexoraiqAnalytics: CLICK events (NexorAIQ logEvent, per store view) and the search attribution
 *   cookie used for the server-side ADD_TO_CART event.
 * - window.nexoraiqCart: Add to Cart. Posts the SKU to nexoraiq/cart/add, which forwards to
 *   Magento's checkout/cart/add.
